# Valid app routes: serve the SPA with a 200. Netlify matches redirect rules
# trailing-slash-insensitively, so /om-oss also covers /om-oss/ (old WP links).
/                    /index.html   200
/om-oss              /index.html   200
/tjenester           /index.html   200
/behandlingsmetode   /index.html   200
/priser              /index.html   200
/blogg               /index.html   200
/blogg/*             /index.html   200
/kontakt             /index.html   200
/personvern          /index.html   200

# Anything else is genuinely gone (e.g. stale old URLs). Render the app so the
# NotFound page still shows, but return a real 404 so search engines drop it.
/*                   /index.html   404
